WEBVTT

00:00.060 --> 00:01.960
<b>When you see this,
it looks like it's pretty early.</b>

00:02.070 --> 00:03.230
<b>Around 4:00 a.m.?</b>

00:03.330 --> 00:06.700
<b>It looks like the sun just came out.</b>

00:06.800 --> 00:10.370
<b>The actual Gamers store opens
around 10:00 a.m., right?</b>

00:10.470 --> 00:12.910
<b>That's right.</b>

00:14.380 --> 00:20.780
<b>So they probably go in
an hour or two beforehand to set up.</b>

00:46.540 --> 00:48.010
<b>I do like this episode a lot.</b>

00:48.110 --> 00:49.980
<b>Yeah, it's fun.</b>

00:50.080 --> 00:54.450
<b>The storyboard was written
not by director Sakurai,</b>

00:54.550 --> 00:56.880
<b>but by Sato-san.</b>

00:56.990 --> 00:59.980
<b>So the feeling is a little different
from the others.</b>

01:07.100 --> 01:10.360
<b>This looks like
they just colorized the storyboard.</b>

01:11.970 --> 01:15.270
<b>Even the text looks like
it's straight out of the storyboard.</b>

01:15.570 --> 01:17.510
<b>Yeah, it does.</b>

01:35.990 --> 01:40.020
<b>And a bishoujo main character
who picks her nose.</b>

01:40.130 --> 01:41.890
<b>I wonder about that.</b>

01:42.000 --> 01:45.330
<b>Yeah, I don't know.</b>

02:03.650 --> 02:08.110
<b>She says she's different
from other cat-eared girls.</b>

02:08.230 --> 02:10.630
<b>Who is she talking about?</b>

02:10.730 --> 02:13.530
<b>Must be all the cat-girls
who were on air at the time.</b>

02:13.800 --> 02:15.820
<b>There were a lot of them.</b>

02:33.620 --> 02:36.880
<b>How did Gema know
how to make a disgusting smell?</b>

02:36.990 --> 02:39.820
<b>Is this common knowledge?</b>

02:39.920 --> 02:42.260
<b>I've never done anything like this.
Me neither.</b>

02:42.360 --> 02:45.120
<b>Maybe it's something
Sato-san did before?</b>

02:45.230 --> 02:50.690
<b>Sakurai-san directed this,</b>

02:51.470 --> 02:56.800
<b>but maybe Sato-san knew about it
since he did the storyboard.</b>

02:57.510 --> 02:59.570
<b>It's a little bit realistic.</b>

02:59.910 --> 03:00.880
<b>It is.</b>

03:12.990 --> 03:15.620
<b>Everyone is worried for him.</b>

03:23.730 --> 03:25.220
<b>He ate him.</b>

03:25.340 --> 03:27.500
<b>It's the first time
he's been important.</b>

03:27.600 --> 03:29.830
<b>This is the only time.</b>

03:41.120 --> 03:43.020
<b>Who voiced the alien?</b>

03:43.120 --> 03:44.280
<b>Maybe Mishter Manager?</b>

03:44.390 --> 03:46.890
<b>The same voice actor?</b>
